# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Added here: Rise of the Silithid (4267).
# Left out: Lonebrow's Journal (1100). The Giant Guardian (2844) and Wandering Shay (2845) come on the later Feralas stop (50-60/04).
# Left out: Zorbin's Zapped Giants and Fuel for the Zapping (7003, 7721; Sea Elementals and zapped giants 47-49, elite
# giants around them) and Pratt's Improved Quality and Pristine Yeti Hide (7733, 7735; Rage Scar yetis 46-49, #1999).
# Since the Riverglades and Shen'dralas joined the route, players arrive here at about 46: Lord Shalzaru (47) and the
# Gordunni (44-46) are done on the guide's own loop again.

