  zone Feralas
  tip No flight path to Thalanaar yet: take the boat back to the coast and ride east along the road to Thalanaar, on the Thousand Needles border.
  goto 89.5,45.9 "Thalanaar"

step Thalanaar
  when onquest 4281
  tip Ride north-east to the night elf outpost on the Thousand Needles border.
  turnin 4281                         -- Falfindel Waywarder walks around Thalanaar: look inside the circle on the map

